  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.mineblock11.dev/requires_fabric_api.png\" alt=\"\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/UzHtJKqHny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.mineblock11.dev/mineblock badge_64h.png\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmineblock11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.mineblock11.dev/modding-elite-badge.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h1>雪覆樹下（Fabric）</h1><p><em>此為已棄用的Fabric移植版《<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsnow-under-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雪覆樹下</a>》的延續版本，該版本自1.17後便未再更新</em></p><p>在雪地生態域中，於樹木下方積雪，使地形更加身歷其境。</p><h2>設定</h2><ul>\n<li><code>enable_biome_feature</code> - 設為 false 將停用在生成新區塊時於樹下積雪的功能。</li>\n<li><code>enable_when_snowing</code> - 設為 false 將停用在世界中降雪時於樹下積雪的功能。</li>\n<li><code>supported_biomes</code> - 清單中的生態域ID所對應的生態域，都會套用此生成效果。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XVnUIUAQ/images/63dab93d742aec317ba25e1d20efe9e38d32b6ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>相容性</h2><p>雪覆樹下相容於：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomesyougo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpromenade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Promenade</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fregions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterrestria\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrestria</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftraverse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wilder Wild</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwoods-and-mires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woods And Mires</a></li>\n</ul><h2>展示</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XVnUIUAQ/images/95acbae40da17b074a1133d26a213107e43393ef.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>使用我的模組，即表示您同意<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimb11.dev%252flegal%252fmodpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組包發布指南</a>與<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimb11.dev%252flegal%252feula\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">終端使用者授權協議</a></p><p>此模組不含原模組的任何程式碼，基本上已完全重寫，因此選擇以 ARR 授權。所有 2.2.0 之前的版本仍為 MIT 授權，您可以在 GitHub 上查看其程式碼。</p>",
